    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d383">

                <pb facs="0427" n="415" sameAs="frus:frus1945v08/pg415"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.24591/9–2145: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Iran</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Murray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tehran</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-09-21T14:00:00+03:25">September 21,
                            1945—2 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received September 21—11:30 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>752. Minister of Foreign Affairs announced in Majlis yesterday results his
                    conversation with Maximov that morning at which latter stated all Soviet troops
                    were in process of evacuating Tehran and environs, <pb facs="0428" n="416"
                        xml:id="pg416"/> particularly Ghaleh Morghi Airport and that these troops
                    would go directly to the Soviet Union. Sepahbodi also reported result of
                    subsequent telephone call from Maximov announcing final termination Soviet
                    censorship in Iran.</p>
                <p>President of Majlis following Sepahbodi’s speech thanked Soviet Government in
                    name of Majlis for setting example for evacuation of Tehran.</p>
                <p>Sent Department as 752 repeated London as 64 Moscow as 240.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Murray</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
